{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_049EF0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"知道吗，Snake？听说哥斯达黎加近海有一座怪物岛。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"怪物岛？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"听说18世纪的海盗会从加勒比海一路把船开到太平洋一侧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"Stevenson的《金银岛》也是以哥斯达黎加近海的岛为原型。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"《金银岛》啊！真怀念。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Snake你也读过？那就好说了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"尼加拉瓜也流传着这样的海盗传说，说他们曾在海上遭遇会飞的怪物。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"甚至还有海盗登上怪物岛的传说。不过，那座岛的位置没有留下记录。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"所以我一直都想来哥斯达黎加。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"哈哈，那挺不错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"听说哥斯达黎加某个地方有一只会说话的猫，能带人去那座岛。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"那倒是个有趣的故事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"想再多了解一点那座岛吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"现在不用。要是哪天真要去那座岛，到时候再讲给我听。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"明白。那就到时候再说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""}]}